      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-27994-28009">しかし、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28009-28075"><rb>十時四十八分發</rb><rt>じふじよんじふはちふんはつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28075-28090">には、まだ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28090-28123"><rb>十分間</rb><rt>じつぷんかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28123-28135">ある、と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28135-28156"><rb>見較</rb><rt>みくら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28156-28168">べると、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28168-28201"><rb>改札口</rb><rt>かいさつぐち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28201-28210">には、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28210-28222"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28222-28228">らん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28228-28243"><rb>顏</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28243-28249">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28249-28282"><rb>糸崎行</rb><rt>いとざきゆき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28282-28285">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28285-28300"><rb>札</rb><rt>ふだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28300-28303">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28303-28318"><rb>掛</rb><rt>かゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28318-28327">つて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28327-28351"><rb>改札</rb><rt>かいさつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28351-28357">のお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28357-28375"><rb>係</rb><rt>かゝり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28375-28381">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28381-28399"><rb>剪</rb><rt>はさみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28399-28402">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28402-28417"><rb>二</rb><rt>ふた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-28417-28429">つばかり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-28429-28453"><rb>制服</rb><rt>せいふく</rt></ruby><seg sou