      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-32356-32365">――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32365-32386"><rb>後日</rb><rt>ごじつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32386-32389">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32389-32425"><rb>東京驛</rb><rt>とうきやうえき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32425-32428">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32428-32443"><rb>歸</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32443-32449">つた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32449-32464"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32464-32467">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32467-32485"><rb>居合</rb><rt>ゐあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32485-32494">はせた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32494-32527"><rb>赤帽君</rb><rt>あかばうくん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32527-32560">に、その二十四――のを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32560-32572"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32572-32581">くと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32581-32599"><rb>丁</rb><rt>ちやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32599-32602">ど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32602-32623"><rb>非番</rb><rt>ひばん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32623-32626">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32626-32641"><rb>休</rb><rt>やす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32641-32650">みだと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32650-32662"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32662-32668">ふ。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32668-32683"><rb>用</rb><rt>よう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32683-32710">をきいて、ところを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32710-32725"><rb>尋</rb><rt>たづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-32725-32740">ねるから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-32740-32767"><rb>麹町</rb><rt>かうぢまち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-327