      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35738-35768"><rb>東枕</rb><rt>ひがしまくら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35768-35774">も、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35774-35801"><rb>西枕</rb><rt>にしまくら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35801-35807">も、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35807-35825"><rb>枕</rb><rt>まくら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35825-35837">したまゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35837-35855"><rb>何處</rb><rt>どこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35855-35867">をさして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35867-35879"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35879-35900">くのであらう。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35900-35939"><rb>汽車案内</rb><rt>きしやあんない</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35939-35942">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35942-35963"><rb>細字</rb><rt>さいじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35963-35978">を、しかめ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35978-35993"><rb>面</rb><rt>づら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-35993-35996">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-35996-36008"><rb>恁</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36008-36011">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36011-36026"><rb>透</rb><rt>すか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36026-36035">すと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36035-36050"><rb>分</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36050-36062">つた――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36062-36089"><rb>遙々</rb><rt><seg source="#source-36071-36077">はる</seg><choice source="#source-36077-36086"><orig>／″＼</orig><reg>〲</reg></choice></rt></ruby><seg source="#source-36089-36092">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36092-36110"><rb>京</rb><rt>きやう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-36110-36134"><rb>大阪</rb><rt>おほさか</rt></ru