      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-52758-52782">と、とのさまは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52782-52797"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52797-52800">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52800-52821"><rb>二合</rb><rt>にがふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52821-52827">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52827-52848"><rb>大分</rb><rt>だいぶ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52848-52875"><rb>御機嫌</rb><rt>ごきげん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52875-52902">。ストンと、いや、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52902-52917"><rb>床</rb><rt>ゆか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52917-52920">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52920-52944"><rb>柔軟</rb><rt>やはらか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-52944-52989">いから、ストンでない、スポンと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-52989-53001"><rb>寢</rb><rt>ね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53001-53007">て、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53007-53034"><rb>肱枕</rb><rt>ひぢまくら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53034-53040">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53040-53079"><rb>阪地到來</rb><rt>はんちたうらい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53079-53082">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53082-53106"><rb>芳酒</rb><rt>うまざけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53106-53109">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53109-53124"><rb>醉</rb><rt>ゑひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53124-53136">だけに、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53136-53157"><rb>地唄</rb><rt>ぢうた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53157-53169">とやらを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53169-53193"><rb>口誦</rb><rt>くちずさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53193-53201">む。</seg></p>
