        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-53369-53378">――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53378-53393"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53393-53402">とか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53402-53417"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53417-53420">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53420-53435"><rb>袖</rb><rt>そで</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53435-53453">。……たゞし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53453-53468"><rb>節</rb><rt>ふし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53468-53477">なし、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53477-53492"><rb>忘</rb><rt>わす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53492-53498">れた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53498-53516"><rb>處</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53516-53525">はうろ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53525-53537"><rb>拔</rb><rt>ぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53537-53546">きで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53546-53567"><rb>章句</rb><rt>もんく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53567-53570">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53570-53585"><rb>口</rb><rt>くち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53585-53600">のうちで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53600-53615"><rb>唯</rb><rt>たゞ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53615-53636"><rb>引張</rb><rt>ひつぱ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53636-53650">る。……</seg></p>
